      "arabic": "١١٧٣٩- ليلى بنت حكيم:\nتقدم كلام ابن الأثير أنه جوّز أنها بنت الخطيم فصحفت، والّذي يظهر أنها هي. واللَّه أعلم.\nحرف الميم\nالقسم الأول",
      "english": "11739 — Layla bint Hakim:\n\nIt was stated above in Ibn al-Athir's discussion that he considered it possible that she was Layla bint al-Khatim and that the name had been miscopied. What appears correct is that she is indeed that same woman. Allah knows best.\n\nTHE LETTER MIM\n\nSECTION ONE",
